    "body": "@NagayamaToshiaki, you need to put that html in a `code block` or GitHub is going to try to to display it.\r\n\r\n> In the example above, I believe the second `<rt>` should be above 角栄, but カクエイ is above \" 角栄\" including the space.\r\n\r\nInterestingly, in Firefox (the only browser to support `<rb>`) `<ruby><rb>田中</rb><rt>タナカ</rt> <rb>角栄</rb><rt>カクエイ</rt></ruby>` works the way you want it to.\r\n\r\nHere's a translated CodePen with my addition: https://codepen.io/Yay295/pen/VwrPvwq",
